---
// How a creator's work travels: the creator, the package that carries the work with its credits, sources and terms,
// any app that reads it, and the people who ask. Drawn in HTML and CSS, not as a picture, so every word is text that
// screen readers, search engines and AI answers can read. The arrows are decoration and hidden from assistive
// technology. On a narrow screen the four steps stack.
---

<figure class="work-travels not-content" aria-labelledby="work-travels-caption">
  <ol class="steps">
    <li class="step">
      <p class="step-title">The creator</p>
      <p>Makes the work: a podcast, a book, a course, a video, research, a guide.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="step package">
      <p class="step-title">The package</p>
      <ul>
        <li>The work, as it was made</li>
        <li>Credits: who made it</li>
        <li>Sources: where it came from</li>
        <li>The creator's terms</li>
        <li>A seal that shows any change, and a signature that shows who signed it</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li class="step">
      <p class="step-title">Any app</p>
      <p>Opens the package, shows who made the work, and follows the creator's wishes.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="step">
      <p class="step-title">People</p>
      <p>Get answers that show where they came from, and open the original at the passage or the moment.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption id="work-travels-caption">How a creator's work travels: the credits, sources and terms go with it.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .work-travels { margin: 2rem 0; }
  .steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.75rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    counter-reset: step;
  }
  .step {
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid var(--moca-line);
    border-radius: var(--moca-radius-md);
    background: var(--moca-surface);
    padding: 1rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .step + .step::before {
    content: "→" / "";
    position: absolute;
    left: -1.45rem;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    color: var(--moca-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }
  .step.package { border-color: var(--moca-structure); border-width: 2px; }
  .step .step-title { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: var(--sl-text-lg); font-weight: 600; color: var(--moca-text); }
  .step p:not(.step-title), .step ul { margin: 0; font-size: var(--sl-text-sm); color: var(--moca-text); }
  .step ul { padding-left: 1.1rem; }
  .step li { margin: 0.2rem 0; }
  figcaption { margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: var(--sl-text-sm); color: var(--moca-text-muted); }
  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .step + .step::before { content: "↓" / ""; left: 50%; top: -1.35rem; transform: translateX(-50%); }
  }
</style>
